scenario: readonly-report-poison
A         setReadOnly(true), setAutoCommit(false), report query                                        0
A         commit(), then getSchema() for a log line                                                    public
A         close()                                                                                      threw SQLException SQLSTATE 25001: Cannot change transaction read-only property in the middle of a transaction.
observer  pool backend after A's close()                                                               state=idle in transaction xact_open=true xid=false xmin=true
B         same physical session as A                                                                   true
B         getAutoCommit() | isReadOnly() through the pool                                              false | true
B         insert (expects the pool default, autocommit)                                                SQLSTATE 25006: ERROR: cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction
observer  where B's insert is visible                                                                  not visible (uncommitted or absent)
B         close()                                                                                      returned normally
observer  pool backend after B's close()                                                               state=idle in transaction (aborted) xact_open=false xid=false xmin=false
C         same physical session as A                                                                   true
C         getAutoCommit() | isReadOnly() through the pool                                              false | true
C         insert (expects the pool default, autocommit)                                                SQLSTATE 25P02: ERROR: current transaction is aborted, commands ignored until end of transaction block
observer  where C's insert is visible                                                                  not visible (uncommitted or absent)
C         close()                                                                                      returned normally
observer  pool backend after C's close()                                                               state=idle in transaction (aborted) xact_open=false xid=false xmin=false
D         same physical session as A                                                                   true
D         getAutoCommit() | isReadOnly() through the pool                                              false | true
D         insert (expects the pool default, autocommit)                                                SQLSTATE 25P02: ERROR: current transaction is aborted, commands ignored until end of transaction block
observer  where D's insert is visible                                                                  not visible (uncommitted or absent)
D         close()                                                                                      returned normally
observer  pool backend after D's close()                                                               state=idle in transaction (aborted) xact_open=false xid=false xmin=false
